                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fd94c2f6-9150-41f5-b61f-9b0c1d17eb23",
                        "source_entry_id": "6a1cb4b4-49cf-3cd8-9c3c-afeb67f1a4c0",
                        "target_lang_word": "esoteric",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "esoteric",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "99e73a4c-dcfe-313e-bd08-67c6bea2e0ce",
                                        "entry_id": "7d118933-e5d7-3d9a-bb28-461e3ad5faf1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Intended for or likely to be understood by only a small number of people with a specialized knowledge or interest, or an enlightened inner circle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d302c73c-f349-4eaa-abfc-05c8f1be0668",
                                                "sense_id": "99e73a4c-dcfe-313e-bd08-67c6bea2e0ce",
                                                "text": "The writing in this manual is very esoteric; I’d need a degree in engineering just to understand it!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e94cea55-b73f-4808-ae12-f23e81ef9c7a",
                                                "sense_id": "99e73a4c-dcfe-313e-bd08-67c6bea2e0ce",
                                                "text": "In this situation Hitler availed himself of a time-honored device-the use of esoteric language. In all periods of history, when government or society has put limits on public discussion, those who wish to circumvent censorship resort to the use of esoteric language. Exoterically understood, the text is unexceptionable, but to the insiders who know how to interpret the words, the message is revolutionary and dangerous to the status quo."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "903f0db0-0427-3bd5-b68a-c1fc42275cf5",
                                        "entry_id": "7d118933-e5d7-3d9a-bb28-461e3ad5faf1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having to do with concepts that are highly theoretical and without obvious practical application; often with mystical or religious connotations."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2bc81c0e-bb6b-4500-8caf-e615a4fc614f",
                                                "sense_id": "903f0db0-0427-3bd5-b68a-c1fc42275cf5",
                                                "text": "When he spoke to me of esoteric mysteries I wanted to say to him,\"Don't give me that spiritual hokum, friend!\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2e8b2cec-8637-347b-986f-71a846d98164",
                                        "entry_id": "7d118933-e5d7-3d9a-bb28-461e3ad5faf1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Confidential; private."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0231512-dc3d-4fda-a97c-044a5cae2dd6",
                                                "sense_id": "2e8b2cec-8637-347b-986f-71a846d98164",
                                                "text": "an esoteric purpose"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a2c596c-77f0-4472-b17a-48ecbb03e694",
                                                "sense_id": "2e8b2cec-8637-347b-986f-71a846d98164",
                                                "text": "an esoteric meeting"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "esoteric",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3812c6dd-8bf8-3a94-8b92-0e1f1c129a28",
                                        "entry_id": "6d673321-0702-3285-9f38-d51baf0b9b2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An esoteric doctrine or treatise; esoteric philosophy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63a8771a-dbca-3021-8a5c-2cb4f9775b73",
                                        "entry_id": "6d673321-0702-3285-9f38-d51baf0b9b2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who believes, or is an initiate, in esoteric doctrines or rites."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "461274b3-b143-4b1e-b852-b078040cac2f",
                        "source_entry_id": "6a1cb4b4-49cf-3cd8-9c3c-afeb67f1a4c0",
                        "target_lang_word": "ésotérique",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ésotérique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ac6d1c0-bada-3333-8d85-7ace8b212321",
                                        "entry_id": "0b27088e-8fe6-3c57-8c5e-e4967d9bf48b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui se fait à l’intérieur de l’école, en parlant de la doctrine que certains philosophes de l’antiquité ne communiquaient qu’à un petit nombre de disciples."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae6249b5-5e80-45ed-b36a-f38bb9c9b5c9",
                                                "sense_id": "8ac6d1c0-bada-3333-8d85-7ace8b212321",
                                                "text": "Mais songer à Platon et Aristote, c’était aussitôt songer à la combinaison de deux distinctions : la distinction entre enseignement écrit et enseignement oral, d’une part ; la distinction entre écrits exotériques et écrits ésotériques, d’autre part. Étant admis que la relation entre les deux distinctions s’établit ainsi : l’exotérique est écrit, l’ésotérique est oral (éventuellement transcrit)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2a8461e0-1431-3307-bca9-b8f8676ff6af",
                                        "entry_id": "0b27088e-8fe6-3c57-8c5e-e4967d9bf48b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui n’est pas accessible aux non-initiés."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18c612a3-8ab0-4bf9-9fcf-c45163d5d949",
                                                "sense_id": "2a8461e0-1431-3307-bca9-b8f8676ff6af",
                                                "text": "[…] : car il y a une philosophie bourgeoise ésotérique qui exprime le travail intime de la bourgeoisie, son opération de soi sur soi, par quoi elle édifie les modèles auxquels elle doit se conformer. Et il y a une philosophie bourgeoise exotérique, qui est tournée vers le dehors, qui exprime en quelques formules réduites ce qu’on doit savoir de la Philosophie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "511d6944-ecbb-4209-814d-bb9ff24ebf07",
                                                "sense_id": "2a8461e0-1431-3307-bca9-b8f8676ff6af",
                                                "text": "Une longue fréquentation des ouvrages ésotériques m’a souvent fait croiser des ouvrages bourrés d’affirmations non vérifiées et contraires à toute démarche scientifique, garnis de citations introuvables, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6cb5d6a8-652b-44d8-88c2-2b562c23e93d",
                                                "sense_id": "2a8461e0-1431-3307-bca9-b8f8676ff6af",
                                                "text": "Enfin, si le langage de programmation des [machine-outil à commande numérique] n’est pas d’une grande simplicité ergonomique, celui des automates programmables – utilisant souvent la numération hexadécimale – est carrément ésotérique."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b1d56f8d-aa53-3721-a303-d40eaeed889f",
                                        "entry_id": "0b27088e-8fe6-3c57-8c5e-e4967d9bf48b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Incompréhensible, obscur, difficile à comprendre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
